        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-dionaea-muscipula-turing-wavelength-s0-parameter-expressivity>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-dionaea-muscipula-turing-wavelength-s0-repro-package>,
